### :00028  average odds difference
:00028 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "average odds difference"@en ;
    skos:definition "Computes the average of the false-positive-rate and true-positive-rate differences across protected groups, combining the equalised-odds components into a single measure."@en ;
    dcterms:source <https://doi.org/10.1145/3448891.3448943> ;
    :hasTargetValue "0" ;
    :hasGuidanceRationale "Unclear aggregation; naming (\"odds\") can be misleading."@en ;
    # equalized odds
    :hasRelatedMetric roadmap:03229 ;
