### :00035  censoring-based individual fairness
:00035 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "censoring-based individual fairness"@en ;
    skos:definition "Builds on survival individual fairness by incorporating censoring, aiming for patients with similar features and outcomes to receive similar predictions even when some are censored."@en ;
    dcterms:source <https://doi.org/10.1145/3534678.3539259> ;
    :hasTargetValue "0" ;
    :hasGuidanceRationale "One of only 2 individual-fairness metrics identified in the review; insufficient empirical evaluation."@en ;
