### :00038  conditional equality of opportunity gap
:00038 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "conditional equality of opportunity gap"@en ;
    skos:definition "Quantifies disparities in opportunity gaps across subgroups, conditioned on legitimate covariates that modify risk and weighted by a probability for each sensitive-attribute value."@en ;
    dcterms:source <https://doi.org/10.1145/3306618.3314234> ;
    :hasTargetValue "0" ;
    :hasGuidanceRationale "Unclear aggregation of quantities."@en ;
    # equality of opportunity
