### :00057  mean score parity
:00057 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "mean score parity"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "average score parity"@en ;
    skos:definition "Assesses whether the average estimated probability (score) is equal across protected groups; satisfied when the expected estimated probability is consistent across all groups."@en ;
    dcterms:source <https://doi.org/10.1145/3306618.3314236> ;
    :hasTargetValue "0" ;
    :hasGuidanceRationale "Can quickly summarise how a model behaves when comparing subgroups; restricted as only a mean value is reported."@en ;
